n el condominio vibranta.\nubicado sobre av. niños héroes y calle Marsella.\nA solo 1 cuadra de av. chapultepec. en el piso 14 cuenta con co working","fotos":["https://assets.easybroker.com/property_images/6258614/111081756/EB-XA8614.jpg?s=e5a8b7fd694b0297&version=1789857729","https://assets.easybroker.com/property_images/6258614/111081750/EB-XA8614.jpg?s=07555aa22d2eef8b&version=1789857729","https://assets.easybroker.com/property_images/6258614/111081752/EB-XA8614.jpg?s=a3196ad8d2a2b231&version=1789857729","https://assets.easybroker.com/property_images/6258614/111081751/EB-XA8614.jpg?s=eb0f40a50c809e4e&version=1789857729","https://assets.easybroker.com/property_images/6258614/111081758/EB-XA8614.jpg?s=10287d2712d883bd&version=1789857729","https://assets.easybroker.com/property_images/6258614/111081755/EB-XA8614.jpg?s=080da109a3e6fa6a&version=1789857729","https://assets.easybroker.com/property_images/6258614/111081761/EB-XA8614.jpg?s=4ef9d8706862def4&version=1789857729","https://assets.easybroker.com/property_images/6258614/111081763/EB-XA8614.jpg?s=488eea3fc621e7c0&version=1789857730","https://assets.easybroker.com/property_images/6258614/111081769/EB-XA8614.jpg?s=41b6d17b7781ebff&version=1789857730","https://assets.easybroker.com/property_images/6258614/111081768/EB-XA8614.jpg?s=47811ac8cfb23276&version=1789857730","https://assets.easybroker.com/property_images/6258614/111081764/EB-XA8614.jpg?s=6291b47731abb749&version=1789857730"],"amenidades":["Estacionamiento de visitas","Facilidad para estacionarse","Accesible para adultos mayores","Seguridad 24 horas"]},"EB-VX3714":{"descripcion":"Aprovecha la ubicación privilegiada de este local de 90 m², diseñado específicamente para el giro de alimentos y bebidas. Situado en una zona de altísima densidad habitacional, este espacio te garantiza un mercado cautivo a solo unos pasos de tu puerta.\nDistribución Inteligente: Amplia área de atención, bodega/trastienda funcional y medio baño.\nUbicación Premium: Frente a jardín y